 "text": "Geographic Information Systems (GIS) | Buchanan County, MO - Official Website\nSkip to Main Content\nAbout Buchanan County\nAbout Buchanan County\nCounty Commissioners\nCounty News\nElections\nFAQs\nJobs\nHelpful Websites\nCounty Offices\nCounty Offices\n5th Judicial Circuit Courts\nAssessor's Office\nAuditor's Office\nCollector's Office\nCounty Clerk\nCounty Commissioners Office\nCounty Counselor\nCounty Fairgrounds\nEmergency Management\nGIS\nHuman Resources\nPlanning & Zoning\nProsecuting Attorney\nPublic Administrator\nPurchasing\nRecorder of Deeds Office\nMedical Examiner\nRoad and Bridge - East\nRoad and Bridge - West\nSheriff's Office\nTreasurer's Office\nResident Information\nResident Information\nAssessor's Office\nCollector's Office\nEmergency Management\nEmployment Opportunities\nMarriage Licenses\nMilitary Discharge Records\nMissouri Property Tax Credit Program\nProsecuting Attorney's Office\nPublic Record Search\nSheriff's Office\nVoting Information\nEconomic Development\nEconomic Development\nAuditor's Office\nMerchant & Manufacturer License\nPlanning & Zoning\nPurchasing\nReal Estate\nRecorder's Office\nBuchanan County Comprehensive Plan\nService Center\nService Center\nAssessor's Office\nChild Support Enforcement Services\nCollector's Office\nEmployment Opportunities\nGIS\nMarriage Licenses\nMerchant & Manufacturer License\nMissouri Property Tax Credit Program\nMissouri Unclaimed Property\nNew Residents\nOnline Payments\nOpioid Settlement Funds\nPermits and Licenses\nPublic Record Search\nPurchasing\nReal Estate\nResidential Watch\nVictim's Services\nVoting Information\nMy Profile\nBuchanan County Missouri\n/ GIS Department\nGeographic Information Systems (GIS)\nGIS is a collection of computer hardware, software, and geographic data for capturing, storing, updating, manipulating, analyzing, and displaying all forms of geographically referenced information.\nPopular Pages\nGeographic Information Systems (GIS) Popular Pages\nView the interactive online GIS Map Portal\nWebGIS Subscription Information Sheet\nData and Services\nGIS License Agreement\nData and Map Pricing\nCadastral Mapping Survey Standards\nContact\nDepartment Name\nGIS Department\nShane Resler\nGIS Coordinator\nEmail Shane Resler\nPhone : (816) 271-1506\nAddress\n411 Jules Street, Room 224, Saint Joseph, MO 64501\nPhone\n816-271-1506\nHours of Operation\nMonday - Friday\n08:00 AM - 04:30 PM\nHelpful Links\nPlat Books\nCurrent County Map (PDF)\nFinal Plat Requirements\nBanner Image\nParent Page\nBuchanan County Missouri\nGeographic Information Systems (GIS)\nGIS is a collection of computer hardware, software, and geographic data for capturing, storing, updating, manipulating, analyzing, and displaying all forms of geographically referenced information.\nDepartment\nGIS Department\nHeader Menu\nNo content items.\nView the interactive online GIS Map Portal .\nResponsibilities of the GIS Coordinator\nUpdate the GIS system and tax maps daily with ownership splits and combines that take place in the county and the City of St. Joseph.\nProvide customers the opportunity to purchase GIS maps and custom GIS maps to meet their needs.\nProvide maps for departments in the Courthouse as requested.\nOrganize meetings with the City of St. Joseph to continue our work together using the GIS system.\nMaintain data layers for the WebGIS\nMaintain data layers for the City of St. Joseph and their Planning and Zoning Department.\nCreate and maintain layers for the following departments within the Courthouse: Clerk's Office\nAssessor's Office\nPlanning and Zoning\nRoad and Bridge\nEmergency Management\nSheriff's Department\nDownloadable PDF's\nUpdated PDF maps coming soon\nQuick Links\nCourt Orders\nData & Services\nData and Map Pricing\nFinal Plat Requirements\nGIS License Agreement\nView All\nPlat Books\nType : HotTopics\nCurrent County Map (PDF)\nType : HotTopics\nFinal Plat Requirements\nType : HotTopics\nPopularPagesWidget (4ewqgec9mzd873c26x0yjh1m4a)\nType : PopularPagesWidget\nNavigation\nBuchanan County Missouri\nTrue\nContact Us\nBuchanan County 411 Jules Street, Saint Joseph, MO 64501\nHelpful Links\nAbout Buchanan County\nCommissioners Agenda\nNew to the Area\nMaps\nFAQs\nConnect With Us\nPowered by MCCi Government Websites",
